<!--
  English (default) strings.

  Translations live in values-ta and values-hi. Anything missing from a
  translation falls back to this file, so a partial translation degrades to
  English rather than crashing.

  Scope note: this covers navigation, screen titles, actions and the notices
  that carry a promise to the user (anonymity, contact privacy, AI advisory).
  Longer body copy inside individual screens is still inline; it is translated
  next. Those are the strings a reader can skip without losing their way, while
  these are the ones they navigate by.
-->
